msgid ""
"**miniworlds-turtle** is a miniworlds-based reimplementation of Python's "
"standard [`turtle`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/turtle.html) module"
" with a compatible API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/turtle/index.md:6
msgid ""
"It renders turtle graphics inside a miniworlds `World` instead of "
"Tkinter, making it easy to combine turtle-style drawing with other "
"miniworlds features."
msgstr ""

